<title>FRANCE: Mercedes sees 1996 results in line with '95.</title>
<headline>Mercedes sees 1996 results in line with '95.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBACH, France 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz AG unit Mercedes-Benz AG said on Wednesday it expected its 1996 full-year results to be in line with 1995 or somewhat better.</p>
<p>&quot;Results will be in line with the previous year or somewhat better,&quot; Mercedes Management Board Chairman Helmut Werner told Reuters on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
